# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:167
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be sure to compare the second example of a hit with the first example of a "
"reflection."
msgstr ""
"हिट् इत्यस्य द्वितीयं उदाहरणं प्रतिबिम्बस्य प्रथमेन उदाहरणेन सह अवश्यमेव "
"तुलनां कुर्वन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:173
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "अन्तरफलक अवलोकन"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:176
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Board Description"
msgstr "गेम बोर्ड विवरण"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:179
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kblackbox; Game Board</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<स्क्रीनसूचना>&kblackbox; गेम बोर्ड</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:185
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kblackbox; Game Board</phrase>"
msgstr "<वाक्यांश>&kblackbox; गेम बोर्ड</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:190
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following types of field are found on the game board:"
msgstr "क्रीडाफलके निम्नलिखितप्रकारस्य क्षेत्रं दृश्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:194
#. Tag: interface
#, no-c-format
msgid "The big black box in the middle"
msgstr "मध्ये विशालः कृष्णः पेटी"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:195
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you must mark the positions you think a ball is in."
msgstr ""
"अत्र भवन्तः कन्दुकं येषु स्थानेषु अस्ति इति मन्यन्ते तानि स्थानानि "
"चिह्नितव्यानि ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:200
#. Tag: interface
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lasers around the box"
msgstr "पेटी परितः लेजराः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:201
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The lasers are shooting beams of light when switched on. Then, they "
"disappear and are replaced by an information about the interactions of the "
"laser beam with the balls in the black box."
msgstr ""
"लेसराः प्रज्वलिताः सति प्रकाशपुञ्जान् निपातयन्ति । ततः, ते अन्तर्धानं "
"भवन्ति, तेषां स्थाने कृष्णपेटिकायां स्थितैः कन्दुकैः सह लेजर-किरणस्य "
"अन्तरक्रियाणां विषये सूचना भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:206
#. Tag: interface
#, no-c-format
msgid "Balls"
msgstr "कन्दुकाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:207
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<quote>There must be one there!</quote> you think. These mark where you "
"suspect a ball is placed in the black box."
msgstr ""
"<quote>तत्र एकः अवश्यं भवेत्!</quote> इति भवन्तः मन्यन्ते। एते "
"कृष्णपेटिकायां यत्र कन्दुकं स्थापितं इति शङ्कयन्ति तत्र चिह्नयन्ति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:209
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the end of the game, the right and wrong positions of the balls are also "
"marked with <quote>balls</quote>."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडायाः अन्ते कन्दुकस्य सम्यक्-असत्-स्थानयोः अपि <quote>कन्दुक</quote> "
"इति चिह्नं भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:214
#. Tag: interface
#, no-c-format
msgid "Markers for \"free position\""
msgstr "\"मुक्तस्थानम्\" इति चिह्नानि ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:215
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can use them to mark some positions where you are sure there is no ball."
msgstr ""
"भवन्तः तान् उपयुज्य केचन स्थानानि चिह्नितुं शक्नुवन्ति यत्र भवन्तः "
"निश्चिन्ताः सन्ति यत् कन्दुकः नास्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:222
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "मेनू आइटम"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:226
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>नव</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:232
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a new game (and abandons the current, if any.)"
msgstr "नूतनं क्रीडां आरभते (वर्तमानं च परित्यजति, यदि अस्ति।)"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:237
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>विरामं कुरुत</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pause or continue the current game."
msgstr "वर्तमानक्रीडां विरामं कुर्वन्तु अथवा निरन्तरं कुर्वन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note that the interaction results are hidden in a paused game."
msgstr "ध्यानं कुर्वन्तु यत् अन्तरक्रियाफलं विरामितक्रीडायां निगूढं भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:245
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High "
"Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उच्चाङ्कान् "
"दर्शयतु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:251
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show the high score tables."
msgstr "उच्चाङ्कसारणीः दर्शयन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:255
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Start Tutorial</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>पाठ्यक्रमम् आरभत</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:258
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start the tutorial of the game. This is a user friendly way to learn the "
"game rules."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडायाः पाठ्यक्रमं आरभत। एषः क्रीडानियमान् ज्ञातुं उपयोक्तृ-अनुकूलः उपायः "
"अस्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:262
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Sandbox Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>क्रीडा</guimenu> <guimenuitem>नवीन सैण्डबॉक्स क्रीडा</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:265
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this mode, the solution is displayed at the start of the game. This is "
"useful to understand the game principles."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् मोड् मध्ये क्रीडायाः आरम्भे समाधानं प्रदर्शितं भवति । एतत् "
"क्रीडासिद्धान्तान् अवगन्तुं उपयोगी भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:269
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निवृत्तं</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:277
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This closes the window and quits &kblackbox;."
msgstr "एतेन विण्डो पिधाय &kblackbox;."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:282
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Solve</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>चल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>समाधानं</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:287
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use it to give up a game. It shows you the solution: the right positions of "
"the balls."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडां त्यक्तुं तस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु। समाधानं दर्शयति : कन्दुकानां सम्यक् "
"स्थानानि।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:292
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Done!</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>चल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>कृतम्!</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:294
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you placed all the balls, choose <guilabel>Done!</guilabel> to "
"terminate the current game, to compute the final score and to display the "
"real positions of the balls."
msgstr ""
"यदा भवान् सर्वाणि कन्दुकानि स्थापितवान् तदा वर्तमानक्रीडायाः समाप्त्यर्थं, "
"अन्तिमस्कोरस्य गणनायै, कन्दुकानाम् वास्तविकस्थानानि प्रदर्शयितुं च "
"<guilabel>Done!</guilabel> इति चिनोतु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:300
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guisubmenu>कठिनता</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:305
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the game difficulty. Harder games have more balls and bigger black "
"box than easier games. You can also play with a custom difficulty level "
"that you can set up in the setting dialog of &kblackbox;."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडायाः कठिनतां चिनोतु। कठिनतरक्रीडासु सुलभक्रीडाणाम् अपेक्षया अधिकाः "
"कन्दुकाः, बृहत्तरं कृष्णपेटी च भवति । भवान् इष्टकठिनतास्तरेन सह अपि "
"क्रीडितुं शक्नोति यत् भवान् &kblackbox; इत्यस्य सेटिङ्ग् संवादे स्थापयितुं "
"शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:307
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Games with 4 balls or less can always be solved with certainty! That is not "
"the case for games with 5 balls or more."
msgstr ""
"४ कन्दुकं वा न्यूनानि वा क्रीडाः सर्वदा निश्चयेन समाधानं कर्तुं शक्यन्ते! ५ "
"कन्दुकं वा अधिकं वा युक्तेषु क्रीडेषु तत् न भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:313
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kblackbox; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &kblackbox; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:322
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "बहुधा पृष्टाः प्रश्नाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:327
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play this game?"
msgstr "एतत् क्रीडां कर्तुं कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:328
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. You can use the directional keys to control the cursor, &Enter; to "
"place and remove balls, and &Space; to place <quote>empty</quote> marks."
msgstr ""
"आम्‌। कर्सरं नियन्त्रयितुं भवान् दिशात्मककुञ्जीनां उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोति, "
"&Enter; कन्दुकं स्थापयितुं निष्कासयितुं च, &Space; <quote>रिक्त</quote> "
"चिह्नानि स्थापयितुं ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:331
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"इदानीं मया क्रीडां त्यक्तव्या, परन्तु अहम् अद्यापि न समाप्तः। अहं मम "
"प्रगतिम् रक्षितुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:332
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kblackbox; has no save feature at the moment."
msgstr "&kblackbox; अस्मिन् क्षणे save feature नास्ति ।"

